  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/19834c919966288c99419a07884d09739eed61fb7b636905d29e78d8456bb0d3.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) ×, ÷, +, =\n\n→ 12 × **2 ÷ 4** + 30 = 6\n\n→ **12 × 1/2** + 30 = 6\n\n→ 6 + 30 = 6\n\n→ 36 ≠ 6\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) ×, =, -, ÷ \n\n→ 12 × 2 = 4 - **30 ÷ 6**\n\n→ **12 ****×**** 2** = 4 - 5\n\n→ 24 ≠ -1\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) ×, -, =, × \n\n→ **12 × 2** - 4 = 30 × 6\n\n→ 24 - 4 = 180\n\n→ 20 ≠ 180\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) **÷ , ×, =, -**\n\n→ **12 ÷ 2** × 4 = 30 - 6\n\n→ **6 ×**** 4** = 30 - 6\n\n→ 24 =** 30 -**** 6**\n\n→ 24 = 24 \n\n→ LHS = RHS ⇒ Satisfies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\"**.",
